    "innovation": "This paper critically reviews the concept of the leaf-level emission factor (Es) for volatile isoprenoids, arguing that standard model algorithms must be updated to incorporate additional environmental, biochemical, and physico-chemical controls to accurately predict plant emissions.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
        {
