            "relation": "HAS_PHYSICAL_FEATURE",
            "target_entity_instance": "canopy-scale isoprene emission potential",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalFeature",
            "paragraph": "Alternatively, in the recent isoprene emission model MEGAN, canopy-scale isoprene emission potential, Ecan was defined (Guenther et al., 2006) that is not only standardized for temperature and light as Es traditionally was, but also for leaf area index (LAI) and for many biological factors.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
