            "paragraph": "With such assumption, the typical Es values estimated for high-light exposed foliage, and ES.PFT values derived from these, can be used in the area- dependent integration of large-scale fluxes. Such big-leaf approaches have been used in global isoprene and monoterpene simulations with LPJ-GUESS (Arneth et al., 2007, 2008a; Schurgers et al., 2009a).",
